    },
    "body": "The fixed four-arm continuation now completes640additional updates per arm. Query-weighted auxiliary allocation produces458/512 authored development answers versus447/512 for matched uniform credit, with20row gains and9losses; both improve their learned parents. Preserve the controls and regressions, retain query weighting provisionally, and advance the actual native NoRead boundary instead of another auxiliary sweep.\n\nThe receipt binds actual source/executable/configuration/reports and the independent all640-step paired-input/teacher/fractional-credit audit. Float/compiled hard state/address/value/answer choices agree; context reset is a coupled intervention that retains held spans and float history. No full-native-serving, absence, general-language or energy claim.\n\nValidation: completed four actual model fits and loaded panels, row/data audits, exact-head review, claim-wording and diff checks. This PR changes documentation/evidence only; no repeated model tests. The earlier source PR1611 carries executed focused release tests.\n\nReferences #1512 and #973.\n",
