      "body": "# Independent exact-head results review\n\nReviewer: `/root/adoption_review_architecture`. Verdict: **APPROVE** the scoped results/documentation delivery at commit `16676b156235308b2a85847e501613a9f53fc309`, tree `0b99e992b4dfd3745f95d94eb268b58cfc9016e3`. I did not author the four reviewed delivery files. I authored earlier value components and the separate adversarial interpretation, so this is an independent review of the current result receipt and claims, not a claim of nonauthorship of the entire model.\n\nReviewed paths: `docs/integration/geometric-query-credit-result-2026-10-02.md`, `docs/evidence/geometric-query-credit-result-2026-10-02.json`, and the targeted additions to `docs/integration/current-state.md` and `docs/integration/project-track.md`. No executable change is introduced by this results delivery. Current driver/helper byte hashes match the actual execution receipts. No tests, models, inference, builds or Git mutations were run by this reviewer.\n\nThe four condition report and manifest SHA256 values match preserved files. Embedded execution objects match the actual exit-0 receipts; selected data fields and original/stress summaries match the completed reports. The copied paired-step audits, row comparisons, totals and limitations match the independent mathematical audit. The receipt binds the preserved NoRead design and adversarial review. I checked the raw row joins and counts in the separate adversarial review rather than substituting aggregate prose for those results.\n\nThe exact-head audit bindings are now consistent: results-audit.json SHA256 `c6ac7bbf3875820c3436867c62efcc52ce70c476770729fd2491cdd64358d148` and results-audit.md SHA256 `30ea278577408b95784f1d79ac019dc90ceb85cecbd32e54987cc6645f8cf278`. The earlier derived-report u64 serialization defect is repaired: final RNG identities are decimal strings `12355479550239716776` and `11629321088715907971`, matching both policies' raw checkpoints. Only these two audit fields exceeded safe JSON/JavaScript integer precision. This was a derived-report defect; the exact saved checkpoints, actual fits and comparison streams were unchanged. The final commit also resolves the audit-note hash race; no stale note hash remains.\n\nMeasured outcome and qualification are accurate: query458/512 versus uniform447/512, 20 gains/9 losses against uniform, with parent406/512. The result preserves related-row/non-IID scope, saturated seed-2 original, mixed reset effects, and simultaneous address/value changes. The added alternate-code claim matches the rows: of10 prior learned successes absent from historical K2, query retains7 and uniform2; query adds6 further successes absent from that historical K2 comparator. It does not imply that comparator used the newly trained address states.\n\nTiming and data totals match raw receipts: wrappers812.722s; forward/backward/update510.700s; teacher preparation249.072s; sampled maximum439,728KiB RSS; 20,480 processed episodes including paired repeats; 982,760 actual and1,147,712 padded positions. The corrected maximum0.0002125502 is labeled actual-position logit drift, and action agreement is labeled context-transition action agreement. Primitive-zero/actual-absence mask branches are distinguished from exercised padding and NoRead attenuation.\n\nThe canonical next action matches the evidence: retain query provisionally, preserve both controls and every regression, conclude this allocation comparison, and implement the prospective strict four-bit NoRead/raw-Q24 boundary. New NoRead implementation/fit remains NOT_RUN. The docs preserve the zero-valued common-denominator semantics, surrounding float trunk/NoRead/output, existing wider value/potential coefficients, complete candidate-access costs and semantic-absence/general-language limitations. They do not imply complete native serving, geometric superiority or an auxiliary sweep. Offline donor compilation and the separate Claude compatibility lane remain explicit.\n\nNo remaining material reporting or decision blocker found at this exact head. This approval does not add a fresh model result, complete independent BLAKE3 resealing audit, whole-program serving qualification or approval of an unimplemented next mechanism.\n",
